GHI Platform Could Overview
The GHI Platform Cloud represents a sophisticated cloud-native infrastructure designed to meet the demanding requirements of modern enterprise applications. Built on proven architectural patterns and leveraging industry-leading technologies, this platform serves as a robust foundation for deploying and managing business-critical applications at scale. The platform's architecture ensures high availability, scalability, and reliability while maintaining strict security standards and optimal performance metrics.
Technical Architecture
The platform architecture is strategically organized into four distinct layers, each optimized for specific responsibilities and designed to operate independently yet seamlessly integrate with other components. This layered approach enables efficient scaling, maintenance, and updates while ensuring optimal performance across all services.

