The PostgreSQL database operates in a master-slave replication configuration, ensuring data redundancy and high availability. It implements row-level security policies and maintains comprehensive audit trails for all database operations. The Elasticsearch cluster runs in a distributed configuration across multiple zones, providing resilient full-text search capabilities and analytics support with automatic shard management and rebalancing.
